        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A team of walkers from Toynbee Hall took part in the London Legal Support Trust’s annual legal walk to raise funds for free legal advice centres across London and the South East."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We walked in support of our Free Legal Advice Centre (FLAC) which celebrates its 120th anniversary this year, making it world’s longest continually running free legal advice service. Here are some photos from the walk."
